# Every text file in this repository is LF in the index. text=auto normalises
# on commit so a Windows checkout cannot put CRLF back, without forcing LF into
# the working tree the way eol=lf would.
* text=auto

# CRLF on purpose: llms-full.txt has to resolve its link definition all the same.
showcaseSite/content/llms-links/escapes.md -text
